  warfareFocus: Maximum-distance combat
  executiveSummary: Wide-open plains battlefield for maximum-distance engagements, extreme sightlines, long-range artillery duels, drone reconnaissance, and autonomous maneuvering across unobstructed terrain.
  designGoals:
  - name: Maximum-Distance Combat
    description: 
  - name: 
    description: Designed around extreme sightlines, long-range artillery, precision targeting, and distance-aware tactical decisions.
  - name: 
    description: 
  - name: 
    description: Units maneuver across rolling plains, shallow ridges, dry creek beds, and sparse cover.
  - name: 
    description: 
  - name: 
    description: Drone reconnaissance, sensor fusion, observation towers, and relay networks drive information advantage.
  - name: 
    description: 
  - name: 
    description: Autonomous units select routes and engagement positions based on range, exposure, terrain, and sensor clarity.
  - name: 
    description: 
  - name: 
    description: Heat shimmer, dust, and relay destruction create degraded sensor conditions and fog-of-war pockets.
  - name: 
    description: 
  - name: 
    description: Long supply lines across open terrain make convoy protection, resupply, and relay positioning strategically important.
  deployment: Fixed deployment budget ~10,000 points. Blue deploys from southwest dry-creek staging; Red deploys from northeast ridge-top command.
