  terrain: Rolling grasslands, sparse tree lines, shallow ridges, abandoned farm structures, wind farms, dry creek beds, and isolated observation towers.
  vegetation: Sparse grass, shrubs, and scattered trees.
  buildingsAndProps: 'Military: AA guns, radar dishes, bunkers. Industrial: turbines, sheds, pipelines. Logistics: trucks, crates, fuel drums, drones.'
  effects: Dust haze, heat shimmer, mirage distortion, and wind gusts.
  audio: Wind, machinery, radio chatter, and drone hum.
  lodBudget:
  - category: Primary Terrain
    count: 3
    trianglesPerItem: 200000
    totalTriangles: 600000
  - category: Industrial/Rural
    count: 4
    trianglesPerItem: 80000
    totalTriangles: 320000
  - category: Buildings
    count: 15
    trianglesPerItem: 50000
    totalTriangles: 750000
  - category: Roads/Paths
    count: 4
